{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>大圍隆亨邨。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>大圍隆亨邨發生爆竊案。 今日（22日）早上10時02分，大圍隆亨邨慧心樓一名八旬老婦有金飾被盜去，銀行戶口內部分存款亦被轉走，懷疑與其失聯外傭有關，於是報警。警方接報後到場調查，實際損失仍有待點算，將案件暫列「爆竊」跟進，正在追緝外傭下落。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:21:50.547451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:51:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:41.871947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:41.871947+00:00","content_hash":"542425b9d972069728847cfffd1578bbc4a7f814d9d3eaf37cf4e37ac7b03b35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}